  "changelog": {
    "zh-Hant": "第一版：2025 年 10 月至 2026 年 9 月共 12 個月的站間起訖月彙總網絡。120 個車站名稱照原始資料保留；11 個只出現在進站欄，0 個只出現在出站欄（節點屬性 appears_as）。2025-12 的檔案含 2026-01-01 凌晨（6 時前）的通宵營運旅次 112,999 人次，依原始檔計入 2025-12。共 12 個月份快照：每個起訖配對在每個快照中最多一條連結，跨快照的配對共 12,998 組，同一快照內沒有重複的配對。含 1,298 條自環（起點與終點相同）。",
    "en": "First version, monthly station-to-station OD networks for the 12 months from October 2025 to September 2026. 120 station names are kept as the source gives them; 11 appear only as entries and 0 only as exits (node attribute appears_as). The 2025-12 file carries 112,999 trips from 2026-01-01 before 06:00 (all-night service); they count for 2025-12, as the source files them. 12 monthly snapshots: a pair has at most one link per snapshot, 12,998 distinct pairs across snapshots; no pair repeats within a snapshot. Self-loops (source equals target): 1,298."
  },
